# Build context is this directory (see TiltGuard.API/Dockerfile).
#
# Excluding bin/ and obj/ is load-bearing, not cosmetic: the Dockerfile restores
# before copying sources and then publishes with --no-restore. Letting the
# host's obj/ land on top of that restore would overwrite project.assets.json
# with one built for a different RID and break the publish.

# .NET build output
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/out/
*.user
*.suo
.vs/

# Local-only configuration and secrets — never bake these into an image.
**/appsettings.Development.json
**/appsettings.Local.json
.env
.env.*
**/*.pfx
**/*.key
**/*.pem

# Source control and CI
.git/
.gitignore
.github/
.dockerignore
docker-compose*.yml
Dockerfile*

# Editor / OS noise
.idea/
.vscode/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Docs and sibling workspaces (not part of the backend build)
**/*.md
